      "en": "On the third day Abraham lifted up his eyes, and saw the place far off.",
      "ko": "제 삼일에 아브라함이 눈을 들어 그곳을 멀리 바라본지라",
      "source_text_hash": "45aee4e2210cab5f40e2f4669644851e6d18f4b77267c6c4cfa0a41ec71fb726",
      "translation_text_hash": "492c68f36fdcdb1b34bc519db53374957244965dc7fbc2ee02ddc96ece820424",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
