          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "Abraham took the wood of the burnt offering and laid it on Isaac his son. He took in his hand the fire and the knife. They both went together.",
      "ko": "아브라함이 이에 번제 나무를 취하여 그 아들 이삭에게 지우고 자기는 불과 칼을 손에 들고 두 사람이 동행하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "fcd4f9dc7c8c1cef5ee049bb93ed7adb02193c56d54fb70728c9a83a44a21f52",
      "translation_text_hash": "c74afdf235d62caa36d81459675f9f0cee97c775209b7d6501f1e3007cbcde16",
